  {
   "id": "arcade-spirits-the-new-challengers-145278@1.5",
   "gameId": "arcade-spirits-the-new-challengers-145278",
   "displayName": "Update 1.5",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-06-28T16:00:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Important 1.5 Update: Please Read",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello again to all you Retro Romancers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have an important update for you today regarding the 1.5 patch heading to Arcade Spirits: The New Challengers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The update will be released on June 30, 2022, and will include several fixes including:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for the Skip button during new playthroughs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Several fixes for the Linux version.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Typos and misgendering errors addressed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A Content Warning has been added to show prior to starting Chapter 6.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "However, while testing, we have noticed that this update may cause players to lose their current Saved Games. Most notably, the saves made during the choice menu, while a voice line/sound FX is playing, or when a notable visual effect (such as pop-up animation) is activated are among the affected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To reduce the chance of experiencing any issues please save your game during a scene containing normal text dialogue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Alternatively, while Steam will automatically update to 1.5, you can use these instructions to return to an earlier version of the game if you find that your save was affected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "To keep playing on your original save affected by 1.5",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Right-click on the app in the Steam library",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Click \"properties\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Select \"betas\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Select \"Rollback\" from the opt-in dropdown",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Steam should automatically update and begin downloading the selected version",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This should allow you to carry on your playthrough on the 1.3 build of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fiction Factory Games & PQube",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Join Arcade Spirits on",
     "items": [
